PROJECT TITLE
AI FITNESS PLAN

1. INTRODUCTION

The AI Fitness Plan project is designed to provide personalized fitness recommendations based on the user's fitness goals and basic requirements.

2. FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS

• The system should collect basic user information.
• The system should identify the user's fitness goal.
• The system should provide suitable workout recommendations.
• The system should generate a personalized fitness plan.
• The user should be able to view the recommended plan easily.

3. NON-FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS

• The system should be simple and user-friendly.
• The recommendations should be easy to understand.
• The system should provide results quickly.
• The system should be reliable and easy to use.

4. USER REQUIREMENTS

The user provides basic information such as:
• Fitness goal
• Fitness level
• Available workout time
• Preferred type of activity

5. SOFTWARE REQUIREMENTS

• Python
• Artificial Intelligence tools/concepts
• Web browser
• GitHub

6. HARDWARE REQUIREMENTS

• Computer or laptop
• Keyboard and mouse
• Internet connection

7. EXPECTED RESULT

The system should analyze the user's requirements and provide a suitable personalized fitness plan.
